# How this version's Korean, German, Spanish and French card text was made (W3C PROV-O): from the
# previous version, the mapping that says what each card is about, and the labels of each Wikidata
# item at the revision named here, by the script named here. English and Swedish text, and the
# notes, are the previous version's. To make it again, with the mapping as it was committed with
# this version, or to check that its cards come out byte for byte the same from the same
# revisions, from the repository root:
